hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"152","La ilaha illallahu wallahu akbar, la ilaha illallahu wahdahu, la ilaha illallahu wahdahu la sharika lahu, la ilaha illallahu lahul mulku wa lahul hamd, la ilaha illallahu wa la hawla wa la quwwata illa billah.. There is no god but Allah, and Allah is the Greatest. There is no god but Allah, alone. There is no god but Allah, alone, with no partner. There is no god but Allah, to Him belongs all sovereignty and to Him belongs all praise. There is no god but Allah, and there is no power and no strength except with Allah."
"153","Man kana akhir kalamahu \La ilaha illa Allah\"" dakhala al-jannah.. Whose last words are \""There is no god but Allah\"" will enter Paradise."""
